libdatovka
------------------------------------------
Client library for accessing ISDS SOAP services

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libcurl-devel-8.22.0-1
  libcurl4-8.22.0-1
  libdatovka-devel-0.7.4-1bl1
  libdatovka8-0.7.4-1bl1
  libexpat1-2.9.0-1
  libgcrypt20-1.12.4-1
  libgpg-error0-1.61-1
  libgpgme45-2.2.0-1
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  libjson-c5-0.19-1
  libxml2-2.13.9-2
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  pkg-config-3.0.8-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  docbook-xml45-4.5-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcurl-devel-8.22.0-1
  libexpat-devel-2.9.0-1
  libgcrypt-devel-1.12.4-1
  libgpg-error-devel-1.61-1
  libgpgme-devel-2.2.0-1
  libiconv-devel-1.19-2
  libintl-devel-0.22.5-1
  libjson-c-devel-0.19-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-2
  libxslt-1.1.43-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://www.datovka.cz/cs/pages/libdatovka.html

Canonical download:
  https://datovka.nic.cz/libdatovka/libdatovka-0.7.4.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libdatovka-0.7.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libdatovka-0.7.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libdatovka-0.7.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdatovka-0.7.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdatovka8-0.7.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdatovka-devel-0.7.4-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libdatovka)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libdatovka.README
  /usr/share/doc/libdatovka/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libdatovka/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libdatovka/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libdatovka/README
  /usr/share/doc/libdatovka/TODO

(libdatovka8)
  /usr/bin/cygdatovka-8.dll
  /usr/share/locale/cs/LC_MESSAGES/libdatovka.mo

(libdatovka-devel)
  /usr/include/libdatovka/isds.h
  /usr/lib/libdatovka.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libdatovka.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/isds.h.libdatovka.3.gz
  /usr/share/man/man3/libdatovka.3.gz

